# Wi-Fi never configured in OnionOS (no /appconfigs/wpa_supplicant.conf): wifi_bring_up
# returns 2 -> the SPECIFIC "set up Wi-Fi in OnionOS" message, no engine call, no launch
# of the empty stub. (We never reimplement OnionOS's keyboard/creds flow.)
desc fetch: Wi-Fi not set up in OnionOS -> honest rc=2 message, no download, no launch
invoke wrap
config paired
wifi down
sdfile Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_exit 0
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --download
expect_trace PANEL mode=auto title='Can't download'
expect_trace Wi-Fi isn't set up
expect_file_empty Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_trace_absent STOCK
expect_log fetch-on-launch: Wi-Fi not configured in OnionOS
